{"id":109326658638496,"name":"Parkour Civilization [VILLAIN UPDATE]","desc":"! THIS GAME IS CURRENTLY IN ALPHA, EVERYTHING IS SUBJECT TO CHANGE !\n\nWelcome to Parkour Civilization! In this game you start as a noob and you need to parkour in order to get better and rank up! You can become a champion and rule over parkour civilization! Or you can become a Villain and take over parkour civilization... Choice is yours!\n\n[CONTROLS]:\nShift - run (You can run only as a pro+)\n\n[TIPS]:\nUse 1st face instead of shift lock on PC to make some jumps easier!\nYou doesn't lose your role upon dying as Legend and above!\n\n[CHANGELOG]:\nWay to get villain!\nQoL changes\nSmall fixes\n\n[IN-PROGRESS]:\nWay to get God\nChampion obtainment overhaul\nFun things to do with ranks\n\n[NOTE]:\nRoles legend+ WILL be hard to get so dont expect it to be easy. (Hopefully next update wont take a decade to make :< )\nHINT: find NPC at fighters layer to get villain\n\n\nHeavy inspired by Evbo's parkour civilization and \"Parkour Civilization\" game on roblox by Alyth Studios (Ipichlides)","path":"/game/109326658638496-parkour-civilization-villain-update","slug":"109326658638496-parkour-civilization-villain-update","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/53ceea6a2bef859e895f71dacb000ea6c6984c973869f5d6e7d873b64242361f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a9b0a285b16e92bf550f285d6020eb19/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":300261,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-18T19:08:14.031Z","creator":{"name":"VseNick","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Parkour-Civilization-VILLAIN-UPDATE-INSTANT-GOD-202739","_id":"69e3d69e248895514acc845d","title":"INSTANT GOD","game":{"_id":"69e3d69e248895514acc845a","gameId":109326658638496,"name":"Parkour Civilization [VILLAIN UPDATE]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"ht